edit(p,'At every moment `empty + full` equals N, apart from the brief window inside a producer or consumer.','When no operation holds an outstanding permit, empty + full = N. During in-flight operations, reserved permits are not yet reflected in the opposite semaphore; that interval can be arbitrarily long if a thread is delayed. These C sketches assume successful initialization/calls; production code must handle EINTR and other semaphore errors.','Invariantnotcontinuousexceptbriefnotbounded.',s)
