qe(q,'sync-classic-problems-q11','workedExample','An illustrative failure has both producers read in=0, both overwrite buf[0], both set in=1 and both post full. The count advertises two items but only one slot was filled. Plain C racing accesses are undefined behavior, not limited to this trace. This implementation needs serialized index/slot updates; other carefully designed multi-producer algorithms can use atomics instead of a mutex.','Mutexnotuniversallyessentialalternativelockfree.',c)
